'''vomiting''' (vom′i-ting), ''n.'' [Verbal n. of ''vo'' ''v.''] '''1.''' The ejection of matter from the st ach through the mouth. {{smaller|It is effected mainly a spasmodic contraction of the abdominal muscles diaphragm, occurring at the same time with dilatatio the cardiac orifice, assisted also by contraction of muscular coats of the stomach itself.}} —'''2.''' That which is vomited; vomit.
